---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="The Studio · Meet Romy | Romy Salon & Spa · Old Town Fairfax"
  description="Meet Romy — master stylist, color theorist, and founder of Romy Salon & Spa in Old Town Fairfax. The story behind the studio, the philosophy, and what to expect on your first visit."
  activePage="about"
>

<!-- PAGE BANNER -->
<div class="page-banner">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / The Studio</div>
    <h1>The studio behind <span class="italic">the craft</span></h1>
    <p class="subtitle">A small, intentional salon in Old Town Fairfax — built around one master stylist and the quiet luxury of an unhurried appointment.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ROMY PORTRAIT -->
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="romy-portrait">
      <div class="photo">
        <img src="/about-romy-left.jpeg" alt="Master Stylist Romy">
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <div class="eyebrow">Meet the Founder</div>
        <h2>Romy</h2>
        <p class="sub">Master Stylist · Color Theorist · Founder</p>
        <p>A true master of the art of styling, Romy transforms lives with every snip of the scissors and stroke of color. Her career spans 15 years across two continents — and her work has been the quiet referral that gets passed between friends, mothers and daughters, and clients who travel to find her.</p>
        <p>Her specialty is color. Not the kind that lives in a box on a shelf — the kind that requires understanding light, skin undertone, hair history, and the specific way a person wants to be seen. Fantasy shades, silver tones, white-platinum blondes, vibrant reds, color corrections that other salons turn away. In Romy's chair, your hair becomes a canvas for artistic expression.</p>
        <p>Romy opened Romy Salon &amp; Spa in Old Town Fairfax in 2025 with a single, stubborn idea: that beauty appointments deserve to feel like rituals, not transactions. Every guest is greeted by name. Every formula is recorded. Every appointment is built around one stylist's full attention — never a rotating cast.</p>
        <p>When she's not at the chair, you'll find Romy painting (literally), studying color trends from European runways, or planning the next round of training for the artists she hopes to bring into the studio.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PHILOSOPHY -->
<section class="philosophy">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="quote-block">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">Our Philosophy</div>
      <div class="ornament"></div>
      <blockquote>Hair is a canvas. My job is to read the light, the skin, the personality — and paint a version of you that feels right the moment you see yourself in the mirror.</blockquote>
      <div class="signature">— Romy, Master Stylist</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CREDENTIALS -->
<section class="creds-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Credentials</div>
    <h2 class="section-h">Trained, certified, <span class="italic">obsessive</span></h2>
    <div class="ornament"></div>
    <p class="section-sub">Romy and her team train continuously. Here's what's behind every formula in the salon.</p>

    <div class="creds-grid">
      <div class="cred">
        <div class="big">15+</div>
        <h4>Years of practice</h4>
        <p>Honed across salons in Latin America and the US — bringing a global eye to every Fairfax guest.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cred">
        <div class="big">5.0</div>
        <h4>Star rating</h4>
        <p>Across Google, Yelp, Facebook, BestProsInTown — perfect rating since launch.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cred">
        <div class="big">Olaplex</div>
        <h4>Bond-builder certified</h4>
        <p>Authorized Olaplex salon — bond-builders included in every color service at no extra cost.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cred">
        <div class="big">∞</div>
        <h4>Custom formulas</h4>
        <p>No two heads of hair are alike. Every formula is mixed for you, recorded, and refined visit to visit.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- STUDIO PHOTOS -->
<section class="studio-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">The Space</div>
    <h2 class="section-h">A quiet sanctuary on <span class="italic">University Drive</span></h2>
    <div class="ornament"></div>
    <p class="section-sub">Soft natural light. Marble countertops. Warm tones. Soft music. A glass of champagne if you'd like one.</p>

    <div class="studio-grid">
      <div class="tile tall video-tile">
        <video autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="/blondes4.jpg">
          <source src="/videosalon.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
      </div>
      <div class="tile"><img src="/transformation-copper.jpg" alt="Color transformation — black to copper" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="tile"><img src="/blondes4.jpg" alt="Platinum blonde color work" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="tile"><img src="/nails-gold.jpg" alt="Luxury gold crystal nail design" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="tile"><img src="/fantasy2.jpeg" alt="Pink fantasy color" loading="lazy"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHAT TO EXPECT -->
<section class="expect-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Your First Visit</div>
    <h2 class="section-h">What to <span class="italic">expect</span></h2>
    <div class="ornament"></div>
    <p class="section-sub">If you've never been to a master-stylist studio before, here's what's different.</p>

    <div class="expect-grid">
      <div class="expect-card">
        <div class="num">— Before</div>
        <h4>A real conversation</h4>
        <p>Before any scissors or color, we sit. We talk about what you've loved, what you've hated, what your hair does in humidity, how much maintenance you actually want. Twenty minutes of listening before we start.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="expect-card">
        <div class="num">— During</div>
        <h4>One stylist, full attention</h4>
        <p>You won't be passed between three people. The artist who consulted with you is the artist coloring, cutting, and finishing your hair. Espresso, sparkling water, or a glass of champagne — your choice.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="expect-card">
        <div class="num">— After</div>
        <h4>A styling tutorial</h4>
        <p>Before you leave, we show you exactly how to recreate the look at home — products, tools, technique. We text you the formula too, so it's always on record for next time.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="final-cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Ready for your first <span class="italic">visit?</span></h2>
    <p>Same-week appointments often available. Sundays open by appointment.</p>
    <a href="https://booking.mangomint.com/romysalonandspa" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn lg gold">Book a Color Journey</a>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn lg ghost" style="margin-left:8px">Or visit us</a>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* ROMY PORTRAIT */
  .romy-portrait{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:5fr 7fr;gap:80px;align-items:center;
  }
  @media(max-width:900px){.romy-portrait{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}}
  .romy-portrait .photo{
    aspect-ratio:4/5;overflow:hidden;
    box-shadow:25px 25px 0 var(--rose-pale);
  }
  .romy-portrait .photo img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
  .romy-portrait .content .eyebrow{
    color:var(--gold-deep);font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:0.35em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:16px;
  }
  .romy-portrait .content h2{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:3rem;font-weight:400;
    line-height:1.05;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--ink);
  }
  .romy-portrait .content h2 .italic{font-style:italic}
  .romy-portrait .content .sub{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:1.3rem;
    color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:32px;
  }
  .romy-portrait .content p{
    font-size:16px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:18px;
  }
  .romy-portrait .content p:first-of-type::first-letter{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:4.5rem;
    font-style:italic;color:var(--gold-deep);
    float:left;line-height:0.9;padding:8px 12px 0 0;
  }

  /* PHILOSOPHY */
  .philosophy{
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg) 0%, var(--bg-soft) 100%);
  }
  .philosophy .quote-block{
    max-width:880px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;
  }
  .philosophy blockquote{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:2.4rem;font-style:italic;
    font-weight:400;line-height:1.3;color:var(--ink);margin:40px 0;
    position:relative;padding:0 40px;
  }
  .philosophy blockquote::before, .philosophy blockquote::after{
    font-size:5rem;color:var(--rose);position:absolute;line-height:0.5;
    font-style:normal;
  }
  .philosophy blockquote::before{content:'\201C';top:8px;left:-10px}
  .philosophy blockquote::after{content:'\201D';bottom:0;right:-10px}
  .philosophy .signature{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:1.4rem;
    color:var(--gold-deep);margin-top:24px;
  }

  /* CREDENTIALS */
  .creds-section{background:var(--bg)}
  .creds-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:30px;margin-top:40px}
  @media(max-width:900px){.creds-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
  .cred{
    text-align:center;background:var(--paper);padding:46px 24px;
    border-top:3px solid var(--gold);box-shadow:0 2px 18px rgba(167,127,142,0.06);
  }
  .cred .big{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:3.2rem;font-style:italic;
    color:var(--ink);line-height:1;margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .cred h4{
    font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  .cred p{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.6}

  /* STUDIO PHOTOS */
  .studio-section{
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-soft) 0%, var(--bg-cream) 100%);
  }
  .studio-grid{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);grid-auto-rows:300px;gap:18px;
    margin-top:40px;
  }
  @media(max-width:900px){.studio-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;grid-auto-rows:240px}}
  .studio-grid .tile{overflow:hidden}
  .studio-grid .tile img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform 0.6s}
  .studio-grid .tile:hover img{transform:scale(1.06)}
  .studio-grid .tile.tall{grid-row:span 2}
  .studio-grid .video-tile video{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}

  /* WHAT TO EXPECT */
  .expect-section{background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg)}
  .expect-section .section-eyebrow{color:var(--gold)}
  .expect-section .section-h{color:var(--bg)}
  .expect-section .section-sub{color:var(--bg);opacity:0.85}
  .expect-section .ornament::after{background:var(--ink)}
  .expect-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:36px;margin-top:50px}
  @media(max-width:900px){.expect-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  .expect-card{
    padding:36px 28px;border:1px solid rgba(214,185,129,0.2);
  }
  .expect-card .num{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:1.5rem;font-style:italic;
    color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:12px;letter-spacing:0.1em;
  }
  .expect-card h4{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:500;
    color:var(--bg);margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .expect-card p{color:var(--bg);opacity:0.8;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7}

  /* CTA */
  .final-cta{
    text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--rose-pale) 0%,var(--bg-cream) 100%);
    padding:100px 0;
  }
  .final-cta h2{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:3rem;font-weight:400;
    margin-bottom:18px;color:var(--ink);
  }
  .final-cta h2 .italic{font-style:italic}
  .final-cta p{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:1.3rem;font-style:italic;
    color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:36px;max-width:560px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;
  }
</style>
